{'symbol': 'ILMN', 'date': '2021-12-09 04:00:00', 'title': "ILLUMINA SUPPORTS NORWAY'S PIONEERING PRECISION MEDICINE STUDY", 'text': 'SAN DIEGO, DEC. 9, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ILLUMINA, INC. (NASDAQ:ILMN), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS SUPPORTING A NATIONAL PRECISION MEDICINE STUDY IN NORWAY TO ASSESS THE EFFICACY OF BLOOD-BASED COMPREHENSIVE GENOMIC PROFILING (CGP) IN CANCER THERAPY SELECTION TESTING. THE STUDY WILL ALSO EVALUATE THE COST-EFFECTIVENESS OF IMPLEMENTING BLOOD-BASED CGP IN THE PUBLIC HEALTHCARE SYSTEM.'}